<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><span style=3D"font-weight: bold; font-size: =
22px;">Know a lot of people? Turn it into a side hustle</span><br><br>For s=
ome people, networking comes naturally =E2=80=94 and they=E2=80=99re the on=
es everyone turns to when they need an intro or a recommendation.&nbsp;<br>=
<br></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Joe Mindak is one of those people, but he thi=
nks his network is worth something. He wrote <a href=3D"https://d2q-Vf04.na=
1.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VVQHs87tfVGGW8wdcYV5FZWwwW2_PQhc5KjJ=
