qrhL097W62PL0D7l1rlyW15m_0r17rQVxf24Bb_204" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs=
-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"IRdQ+7cQ" target=3D"_blank">a book</a>=
 titled <span style=3D"font-style: italic;">Connectors Get Paid: Build a Re=
ferral Network That Pays</span>, and co-founded <a  href=3D"https://d2q-Vf0=
4.na1.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VVQHs87tfVGGW8wdcYV5FZWwwW2_PQhc=
5KjJqJN8tN9BM2_3wqW5BW0B06lZ3l2W1L8xWb9gxzR4W5KPGVD87qlw_VxW82334FxmjW6VZlH=
Z22Gd21W5KrCLW1XRTskW1QKHRn5cz6n-W94tnmK97k27wW969rQ_7QlXBgVHm0dM4W_tGrW24G=
