a-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"TFDf2X5c" target=3D"_blank">Nolode=
x</a>, a software platform that facilitates cash for connections. <br><br><=
span style=3D"font-weight: bold; font-size: 18px;">How it works</span><br><=
br></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">The Nolodex platform hosts individual communi=
ties. Community owners pay a $129/month fee to license the software, but de=
termine their own membership rules, fees, and commission structures. For ex=
ample, some are invite-only, while others may accept only alumni of a parti=
cular university.&nbsp;</p>
<ul style=3D"line-height:150%">
<li aria-level=3D"1">Members can refer each other to their contacts both in=
side and outside of the community. If a business deal is reached, referrers=
 receive a cut. If there=E2=80=99s no deal, there=E2=80=99s no payout. <br>=
<br></li>
<li aria-level=3D"1">Nolodex tracks every referral, establishing a paper tr=
ail showing who introduced whom, whether a deal was made, what it was worth=
, what it paid out, and other details.&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><span style=3D"font-weight: bold; font-size: =
18px;">Who it benefits</span> <br><br>Many community owners are already net=
working groups =E2=80=94 chambers of commerce, fraternal organizations, etc=
. They can choose to receive a percentage of members=E2=80=99 commissions. =
<br><br>Well-connected members get paid, of course, while small businesses =
that lack a sales force =E2=80=94 and introverted or less-connected members=
 =E2=80=94 benefit from their recommendations. <br><br>Mindak describes it =
as a flywheel where people continue to refer their connections who do good =
work. <br><br>=E2=80=9CYou=E2=80=99re not introducing someone just because =
you want to get paid. It=E2=80=99s your reputation on the line. If I introd=
uce you to somebody and you do a bad job, that=E2=80=99s on me,=E2=80=9D Mi=
ndak told <em>The Hustle</em>.&nbsp;<br><br></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Mindak=E2=80=99s own community has grown to 5=
50 members with 4.3k active deals, while another 600 are in play across the=
 other ~30 communities on the platform. <br><br><span style=3D"font-weight:=
 bold; font-size: 18px;">It=E2=80=99s an especially interesting model=E2=80=
=A6</span><br><br></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">=E2=80=A6 at a time when LinkedIn and other p=
latforms are flooded with AI and you=E2=80=99re never quite sure if you=E2=
=80=99re talking to a bot, but Mindak said Nolodex is all about =E2=80=9Cgo=
ing old school,=E2=80=9D making introductions, and building relationships. =
<br><br>In fact, he=E2=80=99s about to close his biggest deal yet=E2=80=A6 =
thanks to a guy he met at the YMCA.&nbsp;</p>
